    "summary": "The post Jio Share Price 2026: Should You Buy Today Or Wait? appeared first on Coinpedia Fintech News\nJio Platforms opened at ₹1,358 on Wednesday, 21.4% above its ₹1,119 issue price, leaving new buyers to decide whether to enter now or wait. The debut has already pushed the stock close to brokerage targets. Nomura’s ₹1,340 target has been crossed, while Motilal Oswal’s ₹1,350 and Elara’s ₹1,367 imply little room left from the listing …",
